  "name": "Mesh Finishing - CuMesh DC CLOSED Sources, Verified Outer and Rebake",
  "description": "Before Run, choose an original textured GLB in Load 3D Mesh, then select that SAME original GLB again in UV / Repack + Rebake > Original textured HIGH. This HIGH is required by this template; only other general-node flows may omit it. Inspect Mesh measures the reconstructed geometry before Simplify. Reconstruct and Simplify produce geometry-only meshes; no original appearance is inferred. Native geometry, component correspondence and texture projection gates can reject new or unmatched surfaces. Measured closed-control preset: R64, Blender 8,000 triangles and 256 px rebake. Transfer limits are 0.03 relative / 0.05 world, projection 0.05 and cage 0.02; these case-specific settings permit more drift than standard defaults and are not general defaults. Requires the separately configured optional CuMesh DC runtime. EXPLICIT OPT-IN: verified_outer removes only one proven nested generated inward offset sheet per closed outward source component. Open, ambiguous, touching or over-budget cases fail. This is not a signed-solid or largest-component filter. Source component dropping stays disabled.",
